{"content":"{\n  \"message\": \"To find the percentage decline in the allowance for doubtful accounts as of December 31, 2018, I will use the balance at the beginning of 2018 and the balance at the end of 2018 from the table. The formula for percentage decline is: (Initial Value - Final Value) / Initial Value * 100. Here, the initial value is the balance at the beginning of 2018 and the final value is the balance at the end of 2018.\",\n  \"tool\": \"calculate\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"expression\": \"((source:t0c1n0.value - source:t4c1n0.value) / source:t0c1n0.value) * 100\",\n    \"variables\": {\n      \"source:t0c1n0\": {\"value\": 389/10, \"unit\": \"$\"},\n      \"source:t4c1n0\": {\"value\": 343/10, \"unit\": \"$\"}\n    },\n    \"sources\": {\n      \"source:t0c1n0\": \"SEGMENT13\",\n      \"source:t4c1n0\": \"SEGMENT13\"\n    }\n  }\n}","elapsed_seconds":11.140203023096547,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":271,"generated_token_ids":[515,220,330,1994,788,330,1249,1477,279,11414,17704,304,279,40358,369,74599,9618,438,315,6652,220,18,16,11,220,17,15,16,23,11,358,686,990,279,8172,518,279,7167,315,220,17,15,16,23,323,279,8172,518,279,835,315,220,17,15,16,23,504,279,1965,13,576,14806,369,11414,17704,374,25,320,6341,5162,481,13023,5162,8,608,4127,5162,353,220,16,15,15,13,5692,11,279,2856,897,374,279,8172,518,279,7167,315,220,17,15,16,23,323,279,1590,897,374,279,8172,518,279,835,315,220,17,15,16,23,10346,220,330,14172,788,330,35597,756,220,330,16370,788,341,262,330,28099,788,330,1188,2427,60777,15,66,16,77,15,2824,481,2530,60777,19,66,16,77,15,2824,8,608,2530,60777,15,66,16,77,15,2824,8,353,220,16,15,15,756,262,330,18616,788,341,414,330,2427,60777,15,66,16,77,15,788,5212,957,788,220,18,23,24,14,16,15,11,330,3843,788,5201,7115,414,330,2427,60777,19,66,16,77,15,788,5212,957,788,220,18,19,18,14,16,15,11,330,3843,788,5201,16707,262,1153,262,330,39651,788,341,414,330,2427,60777,15,66,16,77,15,788,330,78759,5328,16,18,756,414,330,2427,60777,19,66,16,77,1